ase-insensitive)"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-5","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"True if the key is currently held"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getinstance","children":[{"type":"text","value":"getInstance()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"static getInstance(): KeyStateTracker;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L86","children":[{"type":"text","value":"key-state-tracker.ts:86"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Gets the singleton instance of KeyStateTracker."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-6","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"KeyStateTracker"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"resetinstance","children":[{"type":"text","value":"resetInstance()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"static resetInstance(): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L96","children":[{"type":"text","value":"key-state-tracker.ts:96"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resets the singleton instance. Useful for testing."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-7","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"store","text":"store","level":3},{"id":"methods","text":"Methods","level":2},{"id":"areallkeysheld","text":"areAllKeysHeld()","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"keys","text":"keys","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"destroy","text":"destroy()","level":3},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"getheldkeys","text":"getHeldKeys()","level":3},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"isanykeyheld","text":"isAnyKeyHeld()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"keys-2","text":"keys","level":5},{"id":"returns-4","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"iskeyheld","text":"isKeyHeld()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-3","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"key","text":"key","level":5},{"id":"returns-5","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"getinstance","text":"getInstance()","level":3},{"id":"returns-6","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"resetinstance","text":"resetInstance()","level":3},{"id":"returns-7","text":"Returns","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:63](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L63)\n\nSingleton tracker for currently held keyboard keys.\n\nThis class maintains a list of all keys currently being pressed,\nwhich is useful for:\n- Displaying currently held keys to users\n- Custom shortcut recording for rebinding\n- Complex chord detection\n\nState Management:\n- Uses TanStack Store for reactive state management\n- State can be accessed via `tracker.store.state` when using the class directly\n- When using framework adapters (React), use `useHeldKeys` and `useHeldKeyCodes` hooks for reactive state\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst tracker = KeyStateTracker.getInstance()\n\n// Access state directly\nconsole.log(tracker.store.state.heldKeys) // ['Control', 'Shift']\n\n// Subscribe to changes with TanStack Store\nconst unsubscribe = tracker.store.subscribe(() => {\n  console.log('Currently held:', tracker.store.state.heldKeys)\n})\n\n// Check current state\nconsole.log(tracker.getHeldKeys()) // ['Control', 'Shift']\nconsole.log(tracker.isKeyHeld('Control')) // true\n\n// Cleanup\nunsubscribe()\n```\n\n## Properties\n\n### store\n\n```ts\nreadonly store: Store<KeyStateTrackerState>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:70](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L70)\n\nThe TanStack Store instance containing the tracker state.\nUse this to subscribe to state changes or access current state.\n\n## Methods\n\n### areAllKeysHeld()\n\n```ts\nareAllKeysHeld(keys): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:241](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L241)\n\nChecks if all of the given keys are currently held.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### keys\n\n`string`[]\n\nArray of key names to check\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\nTrue if all of the keys are currently held\n\n***\n\n### destroy()\n\n```ts\ndestroy(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:248](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L248)\n\nDestroys the tracker and removes all listeners.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### getHeldKeys()\n\n```ts\ngetHeldKeys(): string[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:208](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L208)\n\nGets an array of currently held key names.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`string`[]\n\nArray of key names currently being pressed\n\n***\n\n### isAnyKeyHeld()\n\n```ts\nisAnyKeyHeld(keys): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:231](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L231)\n\nChecks if any of the given keys are currently held.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### keys\n\n`string`[]\n\nArray of key names to check\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\nTrue if any of the keys are currently held\n\n***\n\n### isKeyHeld()\n\n```ts\nisKeyHeld(key): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:218](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L218)\n\nChecks if a specific key is currently being held.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### key\n\n`string`\n\nThe key name to check (case-insensitive)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\nTrue if the key is currently held\n\n***\n\n### getInstance()\n\n```ts\nstatic getInstance(): KeyStateTracker;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:86](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L86)\n\nGets the singleton instance of KeyStateTracker.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`KeyStateTracker`\n\n***\n\n### resetInstance()\n\n```ts\nstatic resetInstance(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:96](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L96)\n\nResets the singleton instance. Useful for testing.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: KeyStateTracker\ntitle: KeyStateTracker\n---\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:63](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L63)\n\nSingleton tracker for currently held keyboard keys.\n\nThis class maintains a list of all keys currently being pressed,\nwhich is useful for:\n- Displaying currently held keys to users\n- Custom shortcut recording for rebinding\n- Complex chord detection\n\nState Management:\n- Uses TanStack Store for reactive state management\n- State can be accessed via `tracker.store.state` when using the class directly\n- When using framework adapters (React), use `useHeldKeys` and `useHeldKeyCodes` hooks for reactive state\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst tracker = KeyStateTracker.getInstance()\n\n// Access state directly\nconsole.log(tracker.store.state.heldKeys) // ['Control', 'Shift']\n\n// Subscribe to changes with TanStack Store\nconst unsubscribe = tracker.store.subscribe(() => {\n  console.log('Currently held:', tracker.store.state.heldKeys)\n})\n\n// Check current state\nconsole.log(tracker.getHeldKeys()) // ['Control', 'Shift']\nconsole.log(tracker.isKeyHeld('Control')) // true\n\n// Cleanup\nunsubscribe()\n```\n\n## Properties\n\n### store\n\n```ts\nreadonly store: Store<KeyStateTrackerState>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:70](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L70)\n\nThe TanStack Store instance containing the tracker state.\nUse this to subscribe to state changes or access current state.\n\n## Methods\n\n### areAllKeysHeld()\n\n```ts\nareAllKeysHeld(keys): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:241](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L241)\n\nChecks if all of the given keys are currently held.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### keys\n\n`string`[]\n\nArray of key names to check\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\nTrue if all of the keys are currently held\n\n***\n\n### destroy()\n\n```ts\ndestroy(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:248](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L248)\n\nDestroys the tracker and removes all listeners.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### getHeldKeys()\n\n```ts\ngetHeldKeys(): string[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:208](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L208)\n\nGets an array of currently held key names.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`string`[]\n\nArray of key names currently being pressed\n\n***\n\n### isAnyKeyHeld()\n\n```ts\nisAnyKeyHeld(keys): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:231](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L231)\n\nChecks if any of the given keys are currently held.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### keys\n\n`string`[]\n\nArray of key names to check\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\nTrue if any of the keys are currently held\n\n***\n\n### isKeyHeld()\n\n```ts\nisKeyHeld(key): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:218](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L218)\n\nChecks if a specific key is currently being held.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### key\n\n`string`\n\nThe key name to check (case-insensitive)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\nTrue if the key is currently held\n\n***\n\n### getInstance()\n\n```ts\nstatic getInstance(): KeyStateTracker;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:86](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L86)\n\nGets the singleton instance of KeyStateTracker.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`KeyStateTracker`\n\n***\n\n### resetInstance()\n\n```ts\nstatic resetInstance(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:96](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L96)\n\nResets the singleton instance. Useful for testing.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n"}
